{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1778614886274,"sessionID":"ses_1e24f3994ffew1W30VYmQnV9lA","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"functions.read:8","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/home/runner/work/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/terms/MONDO_0011236.obo"},"output":"<path>/home/runner/work/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/terms/MONDO_0011236.obo</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: [Term]\n2: id: MONDO:0011236\n3: name: hyperinsulinism due to glucokinase deficiency\n4: def: \"Hyperinsulism due to glucokinase deficiency (HIGCK) is a form of diazoxide-sensitive diffuse hyperinsulinism, caused by a lowered threshold for insulin release, characterized by an excessive/ uncontrolled insulin secretion (inappropriate for the level of glycemia) and recurrent episodes of profound hypoglycemia induced by fasting and protein rich meals, requiring rapid and intensive treatment to prevent neurological sequelae.\" [Orphanet:79299]\n5: subset: doid {source=\"DOID:0070216\"}\n6: subset: doid_rare {source=\"DOID:0070216\"}\n7: subset: gard_rare {source=\"GARD:0002818\", source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\n8: subset: nord_rare {source=\"MONDO:NORD\"}\n9: subset: omim {source=\"OMIM:602485\"}\n10: subset: ordo_disorder {source=\"Orphanet:79299\"}\n11: subset: orphanet {source=\"Orphanet:79299\"}\n12: subset: orphanet_rare {source=\"Orphanet:79299\"}\n13: subset: otar {source=\"MONDO:OTAR\"}\n14: subset: rare\n15: synonym: \"HHF3\" RELATED ABBREVIATION [GARD:0009930, MONDO:Lexical]\n16: synonym: \"hyperinsulinemic hypoglycemia familial 3\" RELATED [GARD:0009930]\n17: synonym: \"hyperinsulinemic hypoglycemia, familial, 3\" RELATED [MONDO:Lexical]\n18: synonym: \"hyperinsulinemic hypoglycemia, familial, type 3\" EXACT [MONDO:RULE_1]\n19: xref: DOID:0070216 {source=\"MONDO:equivalentTo\"}\n20: xref: GARD:0002818 {source=\"MONDO:GARD\"}\n21: xref: ICD10CM:E16.1 {source=\"Orphanet:79299/attributed\", source=\"Orphanet:79299/ntbt\", source=\"Orphanet:79299\"}\n22: xref: MEDGEN:355435 {source=\"MONDO:equivalentTo\", source=\"MONDO:MEDGEN\"}\n23: xref: MESH:C538374 {source=\"MONDO:equivalentTo\"}\n24: xref: OMIM:602485 {source=\"Orphanet:79299/e\", source=\"MONDO:equivalentTo\", source=\"Orphanet:79299\", source=\"GARD:0009930\"}\n25: xref: Orphanet:79299 {source=\"OMIM:602485\", source=\"MONDO:equivalentTo\"}\n26: xref: SCTID:717182006 {source=\"MONDO:equivalentTo\"}\n27: xref: UMLS:C1865290 {source=\"MONDO:equivalentTo\", source=\"MONDO:MEDGEN\", source=\"MEDGEN:355435\"}\n28: is_a: MONDO:0005803 {source=\"DC-OMIM:602485\"} ! hyperinsulinemic hypoglycemia\n29: is_a: MONDO:0015624 {source=\"Orphanet:79299\"} ! diazoxide-sensitive diffuse hyperinsulinism\n30: is_a: MONDO:0017688 {source=\"Orphanet:79299\", source=\"PMID:33340416\"} ! disorder of glycolysis\n31: relationship: has_material_basis_in_germline_mutation_in http://identifiers.org/hgnc/4195 {source=\"OMIM:602485\"} ! GCK\n32: property_value: curated_content_resource \"https://www.malacards.org/card/hyperinsulinemic_hypoglycemia_familial_3_2\" xsd:anyURI {source=\"MONDO:MalaCards\"}\n33: property_value: IAO:0000233 \"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/4985\" xsd:anyURI\n34: property_value: seeAlso \"https://rarediseases.info.nih.gov/diseases/9930/hyperinsulinemic-hypoglycemia-familial-3\" xsd:anyURI {source=\"GARD:0009930\"}\n35: \n\n(End of file - total 35 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"[Term]\nid: MONDO:0011236\nname: hyperinsulinism due to glucokinase deficiency\ndef: \"Hyperinsulism due to glucokinase deficiency (HIGCK) is a form of diazoxide-sensitive diffuse hyperinsulinism, caused by a lowered threshold for insulin release, characterized by an excessive/ uncontrolled insulin secretion (inappropriate for the level of glycemia) and recurrent episodes of profound hypoglycemia induced by fasting and protein rich meals, requiring rapid and intensive treatment to prevent neurological sequelae.\" [Orphanet:79299]\nsubset: doid {source=