{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1778615858917,"sessionID":"ses_1e24f3994ffew1W30VYmQnV9lA","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"functions.write:41","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"Thank you to the ClinGen Monogenic Diabetes Gene Curation Expert Panel for this request and for the clarification regarding the preferred primary name. The requested updates have been committed in PR. \n\nChanges made to **MONDO:0011236** (formerly *hyperinsulinism due to glucokinase deficiency*):\n- **Primary name** updated to **\"GCK-related hyperinsulinism\"** as requested by the Expert Panel (tpollin) to align with updated recommended nomenclature.\n- The OMIM-style name **\"hyperinsulinemic hypoglycemia, familial 3\"** has been retained as an **exact synonym**.\n- **Definition** updated to reflect the gain-of-function mechanism in *GCK* and includes the ClinGen PMIDs provided (15277402, 24890200, 34680961).\n- A new parent class **familial hyperinsulinism (MONDO:0017182)** was added per the original request.\n- A **logical definition** (`intersection_of`) has been added to align with the `disease_series_by_gene` design pattern.\n- ClinGen preferred-label synonym tag (`OMO:0002001`) added.\n\nThis addresses issue #9861.\n","filePath":"/home/runner/work/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/home/runner/work/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md","exists":false,"truncated":false},"title":"ISSUE_COMMENTS.md","time":{"start":1778615858912,"end":1778615858916}},"id":"prt_e1dc3fcc3001Agg1Bgg0o7EatL","sessionID":"ses_1e24f3994ffew1W30VYmQnV9lA","messageID":"msg_e1dc3d528001rI4zDWJ4O8coXr"}}
